<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Android - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/Android/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/Android/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Android App持续集成性能测试：启动流量（1）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-uid-stat/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-uid-stat/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;本文对Android App的启动流量测试进行介绍。这里的启动流量指的是网络流量，即App在启动时发起网络请求和接收网络响应时传输的网络数据量。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android App持续集成性能测试：启动流量（2）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-tcpdump-wireshark/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-tcpdump-wireshark/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在上一篇文章中，介绍了一种测试Android App启动流量的方法。当时也提到了，通过读取&lt;code&gt;/proc/uid_stat/&amp;lt;UID&amp;gt;/&lt;/code&gt;目录下的&lt;code&gt;tcp_rcv&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;tcp_snd&lt;/code&gt;文件，只能得到App的流量总值，无法得到更细化的数据。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>对 Android 设备 CPU 进行锁频</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-CPU-lock-frequency/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-CPU-lock-frequency/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;本文对Android设备CPU的状态查看方法和锁频（lock frequency）方法进行详细介绍。这有什么用？作为测试工程师，你值得了解。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="cpu频率"&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU频率&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#cpu%e9%a2%91%e7%8e%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;首先说下CPU的频率。我们都知道，CPU的工作频率越高，运算就越快，但能耗也更高。然而很多时候，设备并不需要那么高的计算性能，这个时候，我们就希望能降低CPU的工作频率，追求较低的能耗，以此实现更长的待机时间。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android App持续集成性能测试：使用Python实现UI自动化</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-UI-Automation-with-Python/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-UI-Automation-with-Python/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在进行Android App持续集成性能测试的时候，需要自动化实现UI层面的一些操作，常见的几种场景包括：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;测试帧率时，需要模拟滑屏、拖拽操作；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;初次安装app后启动应用时，需要点击按钮跳过协议页面；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;从&lt;code&gt;Android M&lt;/code&gt;(6.0)开始，首次启动应用时会进行系统权限校验，需要勾选checkbox以及点击按钮；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;模拟点击按钮登录用户账号；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这些场景虽然看上去互不相关，但是从测试的角度，UI层面的操作应该都可以归为两类：控件定位和执行动作。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android 开发环境配置4：配置Android设备</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-device-configuration/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-device-configuration/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;对于用于持续集成性能测试（或者自动化测试）的Android设备，在刷机之后需要进行一些配置。不同的Android系统版本在设置上会有些差异，但基本上都应包含的设置项都类似，如下是以Nexus 5为例进行说明。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android 开发环境配置3：Root</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-root/</link><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-root/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="what-is-root"&gt;&lt;span&gt;What is root&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#what-is-root" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="root的原理"&gt;&lt;span&gt;root的原理&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#root%e7%9a%84%e5%8e%9f%e7%90%86" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;破解Android root权限的本质是：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android 开发环境配置2：详解Recovery</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-recovery/</link><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-recovery/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;不管是尝试对Android手机进行刷机的普通用户，还是刚接触Android应用开发的开发者，都会接触到Recovery。本文将从什么是Recovery，怎么在Android设备中安装Recovery环境，如何使用Recovery几个方面对Android Recovery进行介绍。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android 开发环境配置1：详解Bootloader</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-bootloader/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-bootloader/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在刚接触Android开发时，通常需要对设备进行root操作，而在root之前，必须要做的一步就是先对设备的Bootloader进行解锁。那么什么是Bootloader？为什么必须要对Bootloader进行解锁？如何对Bootloader进行解锁？本文便围绕着几个问题展开进行介绍。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android 开发环境配置0：adb和fastboot</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-adb-and-fastboot/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-adb-and-fastboot/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="1安装adb和fastboot"&gt;&lt;span&gt;1、安装adb和fastboot&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#1%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85adb%e5%92%8cfastboot" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在对Android进行调试时，常用的工具有adb和fastboot。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>